    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kutanya kwa BWANA aighu ya Amoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghamba huwu aighu ya Waamoni, “Welee, Israeli ndewadie wana? Welee, ndena mundu wa ifwa? Kwaki wandu wetasa ghuja mlungu Moleki wingirie isanga ja Gadi, na kukaia andenyi ya mizi yaro?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.21.28+EZK.21.29+EZK.21.30+EZK.21.31+EZK.21.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze. 21.28-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.25.1+EZK.25.2+EZK.25.3+EZK.25.4+EZK.25.5+EZK.25.6+EZK.25.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "25.1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.1.13+AMO.1.14+AMO.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amo. 1.13-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEP.2.8+ZEP.2.9+ZEP.2.10+ZEP.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zef. 2.8-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olenyi matuku ghichacha, nani nichabonya kililo cha wandu chisikirike muzi ghwa Raba ghuko kwa Waamoni, nagho ghuchasighwa mduu, na mizi yaro mitini ichakorwa; niko aho Israeli ichawunja isanga jake, waghamba BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lilenyi ee wandu wa Heshboni, angu muzi ghwa Ai ghwasighwa mduu; ronyi nguwo ra magunia kwa wasi mkeme, ee wai wa Raba, lilenyi mkimbie na imbiri na nanyuma awurighenyi; kwa kukaia mlungu ghonyu Moleki ghuchabarishwa chiaimweri na wakohani na wabaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaki mkukasagha na vololo renyu inyo wandu mseko waloli, mwawuyakusaghika na mali renyu mkighamba, ‘Nani udimagha kulwa nesi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ola nichareda kiture aighu yenyu chichaafuma kwa awo wimmarie chia rose, nenyo mchawingwa; na kula umu onyu uchakimbia kukukira, hata ndekuchaakaia na mndungi owitumbanya wakimbii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela konyuma, nichawiwunjira Waamoni mecha ghawo, Ini BWANA naghamba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kutanya kwa BWANA aighu ya Edomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA wa majeshi waghamba huwu aighu ya Edomu, “Welee, ndeiko hikima andenyi ya wandu wa Temani? Welee, njama ya wandu wa suku eesia? Hikima yawo eesia?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
